('42e2642c-b6a8-475b-a951-d7c37df41b43', 'Elbow To Knee Decline Side Plank', 'Core', 'Bodyweight', '{"Core","Abs"}'::text[], '{"Shoulders"}'::text[], 'Build a stronger core with the Elbow To Knee Decline Side Plank, focusing on your abs. You''ll also feel your shoulders, lower back working to support the movement. The decline position targets the lower portion of the muscles more intensely. A strong core improves posture, protects your spine, and enhances all other lifts.', '78061201', '78061201-Elbow-To-Knee-Decline-Side-Plank-(male)_Waist_.mp4', 'male', FALSE, '2025-12-03 23:26:24.698781+00', '1. Hold your body in a straight line from head to heels. 2. Don''t let your hips sag or pike up—engage your core and glutes. 3. Breathe steadily while maintaining the position. 4. Continue for your target rep count, maintaining good form throughout. Keep your core engaged for stability.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, 7, 7, NULL, 5, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 8, 12, NULL, 6, NULL, TRUE, NULL, 'Strength', 73, 7, 8, TRUE, TRUE, 'side_plank', 'Elbow To Knee Decline Side Plank', 'plank, russian_twist, woodchop', FALSE, 'bodyweight', TRUE, 3, 90, 4, 70, 88, 95, 65),
('42ed5fe2-2c07-4bf9-9307-0d5156655f33', 'Wipe And Hip Sways', 'Full Body', 'Bodyweight', '{"Full Body"}'::text[], '{}'::text[], 'A challenging plyometric exercise, the Wipe And Hip Sways builds reactive power and improves conditioning. This bodyweight exercise requires no equipment and can be done anywhere. Develops fast-twitch muscle fibers for quicker, more powerful movements.', '82791201', '82791201-Wipe-and-Hip-Sways-(female)_Plyometrics_.mp4', 'female', FALSE, '2025-12-03 23:26:40.146812+00', '1. Set up in the starting position for Wipe And Hip Sways. 2. Execute the movement with proper form, focusing on your full body. 3. Control both the lifting and lowering phases of the movement. 4. Continue for your target rep count, maintaining good form throughout.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, 7, 7, NULL, 5, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 8, 12, NULL, 6, NULL, TRUE, NULL, 'Strength', 50, 7, 8, TRUE, TRUE, 'glute_exercise', 'Wipe And Hip Sways', 'hip_thrust, lunge, squat', FALSE, 'bodyweight', FALSE, 3, 90, 4, 70, 88, 95, 65),
('42fa17e0-293a-46ff-933f-3b82b266c5ce', 'Side Knee Leg Raise Pressdown', 'Core', 'Bodyweight', '{"Lower Abs"}'::text[], '{"Hip Flexors"}'::text[], 'A challenging plyometric exercise, the Side Knee Leg Raise Pressdown builds reactive power and improves conditioning. Your hip flexors work as secondary movers, adding to the training stimulus. This bodyweight exercise requires no equipment and can be done anywhere. Develops fast-twitch muscle fibers for quicker, more powerful movements.', '68871201', '68871201-Side-Knee-Leg-Raise-Pressdown-(female)_Plyometrics.mp4', 'female', FALSE, '2025-12-03 23:26:36.985772+00', '1. Execute the pressing motion for Side Knee Leg Raise Pressdown, extending through the target muscles. 2. Set up in the starting position for Side Knee Leg Raise Pressdown. 3. Execute the movement with proper form, focusing on your abs. 4. Control both the lifting and lowering phases of the movement. 5. Continue for your target rep count, maintaining good form throughout.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, 5, 7, NULL, 6, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 10, 15, NULL, 4, NULL, TRUE, NULL, 'Strength', 70, 5, 7, FALSE, TRUE, 'leg_raise', 'Side Knee Leg Raise Pressdown', 'crunch, plank, v_up', FALSE, 'bodyweight', FALSE, 3, 60, 2, 70, 88, 95, 65),
